{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Vanessa and the Rude Customer", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Please Refrain From Using Your Phone", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 2, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > Food for Thought > Recipe - Chocolate Chip Cookies", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 5, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Accurately use important information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Dealing With Customers", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you work in a restaurant or in a shop, it is important to deal with customers properly and show politeness.<br><br>Remember to respond to their requests politely even when you are refusing the requests. Use the modals  <span class=\"italic\">could</span>, <span class=\"italic\">should</span> or <span class=\"italic\">might</span>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Here is a list of ways to start requests and polite responses:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Requesting politely\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Refusing  requests \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Granting requests\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>You might want to ... </li> <li>Would you mind ... ?</li> <li>You should ... </li> <li>You ought to ...  (strong request)</li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>I understand, sir/madam, but ... </li> <li>I'm afraid not</li> <li>I'm sorry, but ... </li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>Of course!</li><li>Right away.</li><li>I'd be happy to do that for you.</li></ul>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Customer</span>: Your waiter was rude! He asked me to turn my phone off!  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Manager</span>: I'm sorry, but the waiter was doing his job. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Customer</span>: You should know who you're talking to!", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Expressing What is Necessary", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": " You use <span class=\"italic\">had better ('d better)</span> to give strong advice, or to tell people what to do. <br>There can be an element of threat: \"if you don't do this, something bad will happen.\"<br><span class=\"italic\">Example:  You'd better know who you're talking to!</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Should</span> and <span class=\"italic\">ought to</span> express mild obligation or advice. Should is much more common.<br> <span class=\"italic\">Examples:  I am sure you're a very busy person, but you ought to calm down.<br> You should continue enjoying your meal.</span>", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "deal breaker ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a serious issue; a problem  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: What do you mean I can't use my phone? This is a deal breaker!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you hear in a conversation with a difficult customer.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "So what? ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "I don't care!", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: <span class=\"strong\"><br/>Ann</span>: You are yelling in front of everyone.<br><span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: So what?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "floor staff ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "employees who work in a restaurant, setting and cleaning tables ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We train our floor staff to deal with difficult customers.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "unacceptable", "type": "name"}, {"content": "impossible to accept ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: What do you mean I can't use my phone? This is unacceptable.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "valued", "type": "name"}, {"content": "held in high regard; important ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I am one of your most valued customers!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "extremely ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to a great degree ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb):", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The customer was extremely rude.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "complimentary ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "at no additional cost ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Please enjoy a complimentary dessert.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob02aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to shut down ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to cease business or operation", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I can shut down your restaurant if I want to!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob02aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Role-play a situation at a restaurant. Choose between the following roles:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Student A Role\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Student B Role\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" You are a waiter or waitress. You make suggestions about the menu and reply politely to requests.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" You are a difficult customer. You have questions and requests for the waiter or waitress. You eventually decide what to order.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Write a dialogue (12-14 lines) about the situation.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read the dialogue aloud.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Change roles with your partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write a dialogue about dealing with difficult customers.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I offer suggestions and respond politely.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I express what is necessary and refuse politely.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I role-play the dialogue in front of others.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn6le05ob02re2img06.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn6le05ob02re2img06.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Good afternoon, sir. What seems to be the problem here?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Steve</span>: I was on the phone with a client when your employee asked me to end the conversation! This is a deal breaker!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I am sorry to hear that, but she was only doing her job. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Steve</span>: She was extremely rude!"}, {"image": "engenn6le05ob02re2img05.jpg", "time": "15000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sir, we take great care in hiring our waiters and floor staff. Sarah was very patient and polite.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Steve</span>: This is unacceptable! I am one of your most valued customers! I can take my calls whenever I want to!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sir, you might want  to lower your voice. You are yelling in front of everyone."}, {"image": "engenn6le05ob02re2img05.jpg", "time": "35000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Steve</span>: So what? Do you know who I am? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I am sure you're a very busy person, but you ought to calm down. You should continue enjoying your meal. May I offer you a complimentary dessert? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Steve</span>: You'd better know who you're talking to! I can shut this place down if I want to. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sir, I'm going to have to ask you to leave."}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le05ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le05ob02re2img06.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can deal with non-standard requests and refuse politely.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "  I can respond politely to suggestions and offers.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "  I can express what is necessary.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Do you know someone who works in a restaurant? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " How do they deal with difficult customers? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " How would you deal with a difficult customer?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instruction